OL,3,ARings of Power filming allows Morfydd
OL,4,AClark to see 'secret bits' of Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Morfydd Clark has described how
OL,7,Ffilming The Rings of Power allowed her
OL,8,Fto see "all these secret bits" of Wales
OL,9,Fshe had not visited before.
OL,11,FThe fantasy adventure is set thousands
OL,12,Fof years before the events of JRR
OL,13,FTolkien's The Hobbit and Lord of the
OL,14,FRings in the fictional Middle Earth.
OL,16,FClark, who is from Penarth, Vale of
OL,17,FGlamorgan, was able to see parts of her
OL,18,Fown country she had not explored before
OL,19,Fwhile filming the third series of the
OL,20,FAmazon Prime Video programme.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
