OL,3,ARings of Power filming allows Morfydd
OL,4,AClark to see 'secret bits' of Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe star is reprising her leading role
OL,7,Fas the fierce elf commander Galadriel -
OL,8,Fand has also admitted how she slipped
OL,9,Fsome Welsh words into her role.
